  id: pho_kimchi_bulgogi
  recipeName: "M\xEC Kim Chi Th\u1ECBt B\xF2"
  region: "H\xE0n Qu\u1ED1c"
  basePrice: 130
  dishDescription: "M\xEC s\u1EE3i v\xE0ng m\u1EC1m h\xF2a quy\u1EC7n n\u01B0\u1EDBc
    d\xF9ng kim chi cay \u1EA5m, th\u1ECBt b\xF2 n\u01B0\u1EDBng th\u01A1m v\xE0
    c\u1EA3i th\u1EA3o kim chi mu\u1ED1i \u0111\u1EADm v\u1ECB."
  culturalStory: "Bi\u1EBFn t\u1EA5u ph\u1ED5 bi\u1EBFn t\u1EEB m\xF3n m\xEC n\u01B0\u1EDBc
    kim chi (Kimchi Ramyeon) k\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p th\u1ECBt b\xF2 n\u01B0\u1EDBng ki\u1EC3u
    H\xE0n Qu\u1ED1c, \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u01B0a chu\u1ED9ng nh\u1EDD n\u01B0\u1EDBc
    d\xF9ng \u1EA5m b\u1EE5ng v\xE0 v\u1ECB chua cay d\u1EC5 \u0103n."
  flavorProfile: "N\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE8o chua cay \u1EA5m n\u1ED3ng t\u1EEB kim chi,
    s\u1EE3i m\xEC dai m\u1EC1m, th\u1ECBt b\xF2 n\u01B0\u1EDBng \u0111\u1EADm \u0111\xE0"
  chefTip: "Cho m\xEC s\u1EE3i tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp v\xE0o t\xF4 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc (kh\xF4ng
    c\u1EA7n x\xE0o ch\u1EA3o) r\u1ED3i m\u1EDBi chan n\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE8o n\xF3ng,
    th\u1ECBt b\xF2 n\u01B0\u1EDBng v\xE0 kim chi"
